["09:02"]={"It was \003two minutes past nine\004. Hanley nodded to the chief housing officer. “Proceed,” he said. The council officer approached the door of the house and knocked loudly.","No Comebacks","Frederick Forsyth"},
["09:03"]={"Sebastian remained seated, staring at the phone, willing it to ring. At \003three minutes past nine\004, someone obeyed his command.","Be Careful What You Wish For","Jeffrey Archer"},
["09:04"]={"In the light of a narrow-beam lantern, Pierce checked his watch. It was \0039:04\004. That gave them an hour to find the key before Barlow provided his diversion to cover their escape.","The Great Train Robbery","Michael Crichton"},
["09:05"]={"Kaldren pursues me like luminescent shadow. He has chalked up on the gateway ‘96,688,365,498,702’. Should confuse the mail man. Woke \0039:05\004. To sleep 6:36.","The Voices of Time","J.G. Ballard"},
["09:06"]={"Secretly, it’s only \003six minutes past nine\004. I set my huge clock (oversize so that I can see without my contacts in) nine minutes fast in the hope that somehow this deception will make me on time.","Milkrun","Sarah Miynowski"},
