["09:26"]={"This was the sixth equipment failure in a week, the eleventh since Nula’s death. It was enormously significant. She nodded, concealing her reaction.\n“There is also a report from the test site, madam.”\n“Proceed.”\n“Test flight terminated at \00309:26 hours\004 at map point 45, sector 14.”","New Doctor Who Adventures: Zamper","Gareth Roberts"},
["09:27"]={"“It must be some time since you’ve been shopping in Paris,” she had told him. “That’s just about enough for a pair of jeans and a couple of T-shirts.” Kratz had reluctantly handed over another five thousand francs.\nAt \0039:27\004 the phone rang.","Honor Among Thieves","Jeffrey Archer"},
